# {{.Name}} ({{.Type}})

The `mysql_database` resource creates and manages a database on a MySQL
server.

~> **Caution:** The `mysql_database` resource can completely delete your
database just as easily as it can create it. To avoid costly accidents,
consider setting
[`prevent_destroy`](https://developer.hashicorp.com/terraform/language/meta-arguments/lifecycle#prevent_destroy)
on your database resources as an extra safety measure.

